.vs/
*.suo
*.user
.idea/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.tmp
*.bak

# ./burnout3 (xboxrecomp-cli): its toolchain, venvs, build trees, bundles,
# the generation key and marker, bench logs and local bench settings.
/.venv-ghidra/
/external/
/third_party/
/build-*/
/dist/
/.ruff_cache/
/bench-logs
/build-logs/
src/game/recomp/gen.key.json
src/game/recomp/.gen-regenerating
/scripts/bench.env
/.xbr-pin

# The developer's own options (the game reads config/config.toml from the
# working directory over the build's config.default.toml); never committed.
config/config.toml

# What `./burnout3 import` leaves beside the game files while it replaces
# them, the bundles' by-products, and game data, captures and game output
# anywhere in the tree. Golden reference frames are game output too; a PNG
# in the top folder is a capture. docs/screenshots stays tracked.
/Burnout 3 Takedown.partial/
/Burnout 3 Takedown.old/
*.dmg
*.nsi
*.tar
*.xbe
*.xpr
*.xwb
*.adx
*.sfd
*.ipk
*.wav
/*.png
/analysis/golden/frames/
*.ico
*.icns
